  enter:
    rid: 2064119014317621269
  headline: Highlight anything. Paint it anything.
  sub: "Search hits, mentions, spoilers \u2014 a gradient, not a grey box."
  body: 'Mark a range and it becomes a surface: <hl>one connected mesh across every
    line it wraps onto, rounded where the range really begins and ends, and seamless
    everywhere it merely broke</hl>.'
